00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:01.900
Another thing that really changed my life
with YouTube is tutorials.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.870
Tutorials are amazing.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.210
You can learn how to do anything.

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:09.150
You don't have to go and take a class if you
want to learn something.

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:13.420
